# Normalize ALL text files to LF in both the repo and the working tree, so line
# endings never depend on a machine's core.autocrlf setting. This repo is
# developed on Windows with autocrlf=true, which kept re-smudging checked-out
# files to CRLF on every stash/rebase/checkout and turning Biome (lineEnding:
# "lf") red tree-wide (2026-07-12 incident). text=auto keeps git's binary
# auto-detection, so images/zips are untouched. This subsumes the former
# app/renderer/islands/** eol=lf rule (Vite bundles emit LF).
* text=auto eol=lf
